 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 526892,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A croissant recipe calls for 500 g of flour. How many kilograms of flour are required to make 10 batches of croissants?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Prefix</td>\n<td>kilo-</td>\n<td>hecto-</td>\n<td>deca-</td>\n<td>base</td>\n<td>deci-</td>\n<td>centi-</td>\n<td>milli-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Abbreviation</td>\n<td>k</td>\n<td>h</td>\n<td>da</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>d</td>\n<td>c</td>\n<td>m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Magnitude</td>\n<td>10<sup>3</sup></td>\n<td>10<sup>2</sup></td>\n<td>10<sup>1</sup></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10<sup>−1</sup></td>\n<td>10<sup>−2</sup></td>\n<td>10<sup>−3</sup></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Step 1: Convert the grams to kilograms.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"500{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{grams}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{1{\\text{ kilogram}}}}{{1,000{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{grams}}}}}}} \\right) = {\\text{ 0}}{\\text{.5 kilograms}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Multiply by 10 to find the amount of flour needed.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\text{10(0}}{\\text{.5 kg)  =  5 kg}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Five kilograms of flour are needed to make 10 batches of croissants.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "5 kg"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
